# Ground

Audit claims using the `grounding-guard` skill.

## Skill Loaded
**Required:** Read `skills/grounding-guard/SKILL.md` and `commands/ground.md`.

## Usage
```
/ground
/ground docs/architecture-overview.md
```

## Output
The draft annotated with confidence markers, and a summary line counting
verified / inferred / assumed.

## Notes
Downgrading a claim is a success. This is self-assessment and has an honest ceiling —
the fact-forcing gate is what actually blocks an ungrounded edit.
